  "cards": [
    {
      "dot": "cyan",
      "title": "为什么用引用队列",
      "items": [
        "WeakReference 在被引用对象变弱可达时会立刻入 ReferenceQueue，比 finalize/GC 完成更早",
        "watchedObjects 里还在 map 中的引用即视为「仍被强引用」；轮询队列删除已入队条目即可不用 get() 取对象"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "violet",
      "title": "阈值与节奏",
      "items": [
        "前台看 retainedVisibleThreshold（默认 5），应用不可见时只要 >0 就在 retainedDelayMillis 后转储",
        "两次转储之间至少间隔 WAIT_BETWEEN_HEAP_DUMPS_MILLIS；失败会按 WAIT_AFTER_DUMP_FAILED_MILLIS 重试"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "amber",
      "title": "分析落库",
      "items": [
        "BackgroundThreadHeapAnalyzer 收到 HeapDump 事件后在 HandlerThread 跑 AndroidDebugHeapAnalyzer.runAnalysisBlocking",
        "结果用 HeapAnalysisTable.insert 写入 SQLite，再发出 HeapAnalysisDone 事件给通知与 LeakActivity 展示"
      ]
    }
  ]
